Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Teamwork
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 20
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.38,0:12:16.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.37,0:00:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, these are the flowers you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.49,0:00:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.29,0:00:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sister, you’re awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.90,0:00:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.44,0:00:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t be nervous; it’s just the two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.21,0:00:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You don’t look too good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.97,0:00:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Have some water first.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.45,0:00:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.61,0:00:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there anything I can do to help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.45,0:01:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re going to head off now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.77,0:01:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.41,0:01:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Weslie, she’s been really good to me lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.17,0:01:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s find a way to help her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.41,0:01:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I won’t abandon her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.21,0:01:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s safe here; let’s leave her here for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.45,0:01:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ll go into town and find someone to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.93,0:01:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You can go; just leave her here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.49,0:01:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,In your condition, you really ought to get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.69,0:01:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ll go into town and find a way to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.62,0:01:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sister…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.61,0:01:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We told you to get some proper rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.49,0:01:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we’re even more worried about leaving you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.61,0:01:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop putting on an act. I’m not letting you leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.77,0:01:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so? Then come along with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.61,0:01:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiao Mei, let’s go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.81,0:02:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right—here’s your doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.49,0:02:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,My doll!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.29,0:02:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Brother Weslie.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.21,0:02:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you get this doll?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.97,0:02:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sister gave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.57,0:02:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Since Big Sister is hurt, the doll must be worried about her too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.29,0:02:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder how she’s doing right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.41,0:02:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry. Because that Big Sister
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.69,0:02:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,has been following us all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.57,0:02:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.01,0:02:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t even think about taking her away from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.18,0:02:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you followed us after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.77,0:02:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really think you can make it out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.01,0:02:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is full of treacherous quicksand and elusive sandsharks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.05,0:02:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Without a vehicle or a guide,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.21,0:02:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,there is absolutely no way
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.81,0:02:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,you’ll get out alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.05,0:03:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I just have to wait for you to run into trouble,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.57,0:03:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,and I can take her away without lifting a finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.41,0:03:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If we really do run into the situation you described,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.24,0:03:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt you can make it out of the desert right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.89,0:03:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t underestimate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.25,0:03:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You’ve been affected by the miasma; you’ll likely collapse before we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.85,0:03:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You never hurt Xiao Mei, so I don’t think you’re a bad person.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.89,0:03:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don’t we work together to get out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.76,0:03:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget it. I have no need for cooperation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.45,0:03:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.98,0:03:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Cooperation is just mutual exploitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.09,0:03:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you ever actually cooperated with anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.01,0:03:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t think you understand the rules of survival here at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.41,0:03:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,In this world where resources are scarce,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.21,0:03:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,everything is a transaction with a price tag.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.42,0:03:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, the way I see it, collaboration
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.97,0:03:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,is a good thing where we learn from each other and grow together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.20,0:03:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,How much longer are you going to sleep? Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.01,0:04:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So, we…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.37,0:04:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I just remember it was total chaos, and then we fell asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.40,0:04:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and it was such a comfortable sleep, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.57,0:04:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s been ages since I slept this well; I feel so refreshed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.57,0:04:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you’re awake, figure out how to clean up this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.49,0:04:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I never expected Cha Erlang to pull a fast one on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.41,0:04:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So, are we still going to capture Blue Scarf and that little girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.29,0:04:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Cha Erlang failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.18,0:04:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole Blue Planet knows Blue Scarf is injured now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.16,0:04:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now is the perfect time to catch them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.25,0:04:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we have nothing to fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.01,0:04:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether it’s the little girl or Blue Scarf,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.81,0:04:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,catching just one of them means an endless supply of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.61,0:04:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to catch both of them before Cha Erlang does.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.81,0:04:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Split up and search.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.25,0:04:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.89,0:04:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m fine. Let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.57,0:04:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue Planet Broadcast:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.57,0:04:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Word is out that Blue Scarf is incapacitated due to injury.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.45,0:05:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Now is the perfect time to catch them—let’s go, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.21,0:05:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,How did the news spread so fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.61,0:05:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re the target of everyone’s hostility right now; you can’t handle this alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.41,0:05:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Why wouldn’t I be able to handle it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.05,0:05:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the state you’re in—why are you still trying to act cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.81,0:05:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Weslie…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.41,0:05:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t need you to interfere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.37,0:05:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sister…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.01,0:05:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you love meddling in other people’s business so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.25,0:05:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I don’t need help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.68,0:05:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you stop arguing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.81,0:05:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And I won’t need it in the future, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.69,0:05:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,If I say I don’t need it, I don’t need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.01,0:05:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.18,0:05:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s simply impossible to communicate with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.29,0:05:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiao Mei, let’s go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.73,0:05:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiao Mei
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.49,0:05:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiao Mei
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.06,0:05:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.09,0:06:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is Cha Erlang’s gear here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.14,0:06:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop shooting—friendly forces here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.61,0:06:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it wrapped so tightly?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.41,0:06:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Jay, thanks for saving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.41,0:06:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.89,0:06:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I need to help Boss get his gear, Wolffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.01,0:06:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.05,0:06:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.25,0:06:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, I brought my gear bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.01,0:06:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,See if there’s anything suitable; I’ll go chase it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.21,0:06:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see what you brought.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.38,0:06:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Banana
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.25,0:06:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you need a full stomach to have the energy to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.09,0:07:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn’t there anything actually useful?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.25,0:07:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s everything I own.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.57,0:07:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and give back the Boss’s gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.97,0:07:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, something decent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.89,0:07:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad it’s too big.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.80,0:07:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It might come in handy, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.37,0:07:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Come help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.37,0:07:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.21,0:07:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a real struggle finding you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.81,0:07:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys don’t look like you’re doing too well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.80,0:07:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of here. Take one more step, and don’t blame me for what happens next.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.90,0:07:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Rumor has it you’ve lost your ability to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.57,0:08:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don’t you prove to me whether that’s true or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.61,0:08:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you really were affected by the miasma.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.37,0:08:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s nothing to fear, everyone—attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.61,0:08:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re about to get our hands on a huge amount of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.30,0:08:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m running out of energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.05,0:08:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull me up; I’ll help out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.25,0:08:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand me your line.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.57,0:08:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave the rest to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.37,0:08:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What? There’s another Sand Shadow?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.48,0:08:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.97,0:08:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m Weslie from Green Green Grassland.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.84,0:08:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve still got medicine on my eyes; I can’t fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.33,0:09:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie, I’ll remember you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.40,0:09:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,See? We do need to work together after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.97,0:09:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,My skateboard is running out of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.30,0:09:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.61,0:09:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You’ve got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.41,0:09:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Just grab onto it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.57,0:09:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, where’s the monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.01,0:09:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I can’t help Boss anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.41,0:10:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Here’s the gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.69,0:10:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.13,0:10:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.17,0:10:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.77,0:10:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You aren’t hurt, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.85,0:10:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiao Mei, why did you go over to the quicksand?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.81,0:10:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it was because…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.97,0:10:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.64,0:10:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Just for a flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.02,0:10:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m sorry. I just didn’t want you two to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.45,0:10:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But I didn’t know how to stop the argument.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.01,0:10:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you liked this flower, Big Sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.17,0:10:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,so I wanted to give it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.29,0:10:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That way, you wouldn’t fight with Brother Weslie anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.09,0:10:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,and you could discuss things calmly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.01,0:10:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m sorry for holding everyone back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.49,0:11:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.17,0:11:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It was when I saw Big Sister’s scarf while I was sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.61,0:11:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiao Mei.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.89,0:11:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the collaboration we discussed earlier still on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.98,0:11:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.41,0:11:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright then—you help me find the antidote,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.45,0:11:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,and I’ll take you to your destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.82,0:11:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.57,0:11:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.21,0:11:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If you wear this flower, it means we’re collaborating too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.41,0:11:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So, no more fighting with Brother Weslie from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.29,0:11:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The kids and I will keep an eye on Big Sister and Brother Weslie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.97,0:12:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You look really nice when you smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.53,0:12:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.69,0:12:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.82,0:12:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I didn’t.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.57,0:12:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You look really nice when you blush, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.05,0:12:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep saying that and I won’t be so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.17,0:12:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s nothing wrong with mentioning that you’re blushing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.81,0:12:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t run away.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
